{"agency_id": "christchurch-city-libraries", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/christchurchlib.bsky.social/post/3mpkgpjxh322j", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:38:58+00:00", "content": "Next week's talk at Tūranga about Gene Technology with UC professors Tammy Steeves and Jack Heinemann is very nearly booked out. If you're thinking of going book now to avoid disappointment: events.humanitix.com/gene-technol... ^MT", "content_hash": "ad3d0807edcc9b2fcfd091dc1806a026a42e4fe09985fbe693dec6720b4acef0", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:6o7xa34mkd7beer6qjanxean/app.bsky.feed.post/3mpkgpjxh322j", "cid": "bafyreiacnc3o4qwtglcu4mqmcxgrjhn5qzd52njglwgkodgemirwl2kehu", "source_id": "839911d3595b0654"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2026-07-01T02:08:30.675Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2026-07/3mpkgpjxh322j.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3mpkgpjxh322j", "source_account": "christchurchlib.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/christchurchlib.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "metservice-nz", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/metservice.com/post/3mpkn2hxmfk2t", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "Wrap those dogs, cats, plants, birds... and any other pets up! 🐾❄️\n\nWe love seeing your pet photos during these chilly spells, so drop them in the comments below! 📸❤️🦜🌿 #keepabeanieonyourweenie", "content_hash": "14861b68cda6430caf07b2ff4b123f7668fda7fb6cedb1c17c0421f78148ff1a", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:wtcbfippu4ujjbg2trbmdkib/app.bsky.feed.post/3mpkn2hxmfk2t", "cid": "bafyreiaf6ouhje2dhk7qb2c7jernjakje2suu66d2arp4le2ac4p2gjm6a", "source_id": "43382f64450551e1"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2026-07-01T04:02:00.134Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2026-07/3mpkn2hxmfk2t.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3mpkn2hxmfk2t", "source_account": "metservice.com", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/metservice.com"}
{"agency_id": "person-aaron-hawkins", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social/post/3mpkni2z4ok2l", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:03+00:00", "content": "One of the things that makes sense on first blush to a hack like me, but still requires scholarship to back it up", "content_hash": "e855aeef5435fe68b110b5f494a88136861a49c03831ce516673041be745b032", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:e35cwveb25ji3x5gm3hzwyhb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mpkni2z4ok2l", "cid": "bafyreibxogvazp3yp5s7rbvmvzy7vdsebp5bzjrgkynzkfqwnlmcbkbnsy", "source_id": "person-aaron-hawkins-bluesky-4e3b9bc1"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2026-07-01T04:09:36.314Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2026-07/3mpkni2z4ok2l.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3mpkni2z4ok2l", "source_account": "ahawkins.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-aaron-hawkins", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social/post/3mpklccnvwc2g", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:03+00:00", "content": "'Has this been the case in Auckland?' people are right to ask. \n\nI think the critical difference is that the Supercity was essentially a merger of metropolitan councils. \n\nOtago would be one metro council, swallowed by (in some cases quite wealthy) rural and provincial districts", "content_hash": "fc7206ae9de51e3cd57f4e09befd3ec1e2b9c7ad40447ec5bc10fd3f9b06c642", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:e35cwveb25ji3x5gm3hzwyhb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mpklccnvwc2g", "cid": "bafyreigoy6rioh47zxyxjitklldg4cfpkqhncqd7b24nh5474eh5tn4zge", "source_id": "person-aaron-hawkins-bluesky-4e3b9bc1"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2026-07-01T03:30:35.526Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2026-07/3mpklccnvwc2g.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3mpklccnvwc2g", "source_account": "ahawkins.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-aaron-hawkins", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social/post/3mpkkpeq6ak2g", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:03+00:00", "content": "We'll be left to pay to fix the insane rates of development in Queenstown Lakes, while they refuse to spend any money whatsoever on the wellbeing of coastal communities.\n\nWhich makes this the only example we need to know that an Otago wide unitary authority could be the death knell for Dunedin.", "content_hash": "dcb65e33b8e7451373d51ddf5ac10dd513d069590992d1c67fdf879f9f2157dc", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:e35cwveb25ji3x5gm3hzwyhb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mpkkpeq6ak2g", "cid": "bafyreid5mxnycqcunw6ninrjtynxkzsz3hp25oqzt5lsfg43667q742dba", "source_id": "person-aaron-hawkins-bluesky-4e3b9bc1"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2026-07-01T03:20:00.162Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2026-07/3mpkkpeq6ak2g.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3mpkkpeq6ak2g", "source_account": "ahawkins.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-aaron-hawkins", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social/post/3mpkkoiizu22g", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:03+00:00", "content": "Even if we could get all five Dunedin ward reps to support the long term future of our our city (highly unlikely given the current circumstances) they'd still be voted down by the clean coal lot inland. \n\nThis is true of climate action, adaptation, transport planning, and so on.", "content_hash": "9dec49be93e56272b6d397bdf029971040f6c836a69117ebdcc935e273506b8b", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:e35cwveb25ji3x5gm3hzwyhb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mpkkoiizu22g", "cid": "bafyreifqxb7byrqkurvtdo7leforluwbqb4dtummfuc7ptbfyr5vfgam4a", "source_id": "person-aaron-hawkins-bluesky-4e3b9bc1"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2026-07-01T03:19:30.569Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2026-07/3mpkkoiizu22g.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3mpkkoiizu22g", "source_account": "ahawkins.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social"}
{"agency_id": "person-aaron-hawkins", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social/post/3mpkkm2mvsk2g", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:03+00:00", "content": "Stopping cities from spending money on the things that they need and want - but which aren't valued by conservative politicians - has been the dream of our right wing governments since Rodney Hide's failed Supercity plan in Auckland, and reform of the Local Government Act.", "content_hash": "6de4095708ba3253c3a9613114d4c0f4836c7fc491c6a482c0c06e4a39bcf597", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:e35cwveb25ji3x5gm3hzwyhb/app.bsky.feed.post/3mpkkm2mvsk2g", "cid": "bafyreico5yguiwieanbtlpnwnxgk5aumvnoaf4bxhtrwdtlv6lionwfgvm", "source_id": "person-aaron-hawkins-bluesky-4e3b9bc1"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2026-07-01T03:18:08.907Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2026-07/3mpkkm2mvsk2g.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3mpkkm2mvsk2g", "source_account": "ahawkins.bsky.social", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ahawkins.bsky.social"}
